<title>UK: SBC sets call warrants on Italian kicker basket.</title>
<headline>SBC sets call warrants on Italian kicker basket.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-11-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>Swiss Bank Corp has issued one million European-style capped call warrants, on an Italian kicker basket comprising ENI SpA, Telecom Italia Mobile SpA and Montedison SpA, lead manager SBC</p>
<p>Warburg said.</p>
<p>One warrant controls one basket.</p>
<p> STRIKE PRICE    *		     ISSUE PRICE  15,940.00 ITL</p>
<p> MATURITY DATE   06.NOV.97	   PAYDATE	13.NOV.96</p>
<p> LISTING	   LONDON		MIN EXER LOT ONE</p>
<p>SPOT REFERENCE  18,050.00 ITL</p>
<p> NOTES	     *LOWER STRIKE PRICE ISD 0.0 ITL AND THE CAP</p>
<p>			IS 18,050 ITL</p>
<p>			PRICES QUOTED ON REUTER PAGE  SBCED12</p>
<p>--Reuter London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
